    preview: "Iran chief negotiator says ball in US court to 'prevent war' Iran's parliament speaker and chief negotiator in talks with the US said that the ball was in Washington's court to \"prevent war\". \"The countries of the region should know that, just as the Islamic Republic of Iran stands ready for battle with its finger on the trigger, it has also given the American side a powerful and rational response,\" Mohammad Bagher Ghalibaf said in a televised speech. \"The ball is now in America's court to prevent war.\"",
